## Indexes (Performance)

**Index strategically:**

```python
# ✅ Indexes needed for:

# 1. Tenant + soft delete filter (common query)
Index("idx_materials_tenant_deleted", "tenant_id", "is_deleted")

# 2. Status/state filtering
Index("idx_work_orders_status", "status")

# 3. Foreign key columns
Index("idx_work_orders_bom_id", "bom_id")

# 4. Timestamps (range queries)
Index("idx_sales_orders_created_at", "created_at" DESC)

# ❌ Unnecessary indexes:
Index("idx_materials_name")  # Low selectivity, rarely queried
Index("idx_work_orders_description")  # Text column (too large)
```

