## Connection Pooling

**SQLAlchemy async with asyncpg connection pool.**

```python
# backend/app/infrastructure/persistence/session.py
from sqlalchemy.ext.asyncio import create_async_engine, async_sessionmaker

# ✅ CORRECT: Async engine with pooling
engine = create_async_engine(
    "postgresql+asyncpg://user:pass@localhost/medtrack",
    echo=False,
    pool_size=20,  # Connection pool size
    max_overflow=10,  # Overflow connections
    pool_recycle=3600,  # Recycle connections every hour
    pool_pre_ping=True,  # Test connections before use
)

AsyncSessionLocal = async_sessionmaker(
    engine,
    class_=AsyncSession,
    expire_on_commit=False,
    autocommit=False,
    autoflush=False
)
```

