## Unit of Work Pattern (Transactions)

**Coordinate multiple operations in one transaction.**

```python
# ✅ CORRECT: Unit of Work for atomic operations
class UnitOfWork:
    def __init__(self, session: AsyncSession):
        self.session = session
    
    async def begin(self):
        await self.session.begin()
    
    async def commit(self):
        await self.session.commit()
    
    async def rollback(self):
        await self.session.rollback()

# Usage in handler
async def handle_complete_work_order(cmd: CompleteWorkOrderCommand):
    async with uow.session.begin():
        # All operations here are atomic
        wo = await wo_repo.get_by_id(cmd.work_order_id)
        wo.complete()  # Domain logic
        
        # Consume inventory (separate entity)
        for line in wo.lines:
            material = await mat_repo.get_by_id(line.material_id)
            material.consume(line.quantity)
            await mat_repo.save(material)
        
        # Both operations commit together or rollback together
        await uow.commit()
```

